69
00:13:48,136 --> 00:13:52,936
賛成だな！まずはルーナたちがやるなら！
Agreed! First up, if it's us Luna and the others!

70
00:13:53,036 --> 00:13:55,036
じゃあ、おてなみ拝見と行きましょう！
Well then, let's see what you've got!

71
00:13:55,236 --> 00:13:59,036
がんばるぞー！おー！
Do your best! Yay!

72
00:14:00,036 --> 00:14:09,936
よし！じゃあいくならよ！せーの！ホロウィッチ！チームラスター！
Alright! Then let's go! Ready, set! holoWitches! Team Luster!

73
00:14:27,036 --> 00:14:30,036
[Title: スイートマジック]
[Title: Sweet Magic]

74
00:14:30,136 --> 00:14:32,536
[Text: 作詞・作曲: Junky]
[Text: Lyrics & Music: Junky]

75
00:14:42,536 --> 00:14:49,836
甘くて幸せなこと 隠し味何にしよう
Something sweet and happy, what should we use as a secret ingredient?

76
00:14:50,136 --> 00:14:56,336
純粋な乙女心 甘い恋も 絡めなくちゃ
A pure maiden's heart and sweet romance have to be intertwined!

77
00:14:57,336 --> 00:15:04,536
切なさ重ねてミルフィーユ 酸味も積み上げタルト
Layering sorrow into a mille-feuille, piling up tartness into a tart,

78
00:15:06,179 --> 00:15:13,079
苦味もチョコレートケーキ？ 魔法かけた甘い奇跡
Even bitterness becomes a chocolate cake? A sweet miracle with a spell cast.

79
00:15:13,079 --> 00:15:16,559
甘さを抑えてビターとか
Trying to tone down the sweetness with bitterness...

80
00:15:16,559 --> 00:15:24,159
ミルクなしのコーヒーとか 甘いだけじゃ大人になれないの？
Or coffee without milk... does just being sweet not make you an adult?

81
00:15:24,159 --> 00:15:32,159
そんなの絶対に絶対やだやだやだ
I absolutely, absolutely don't want that, no, no, no!

82
00:15:32,159 --> 00:15:38,459
ねぇ あげようか 甘い罠 ほら虜にしてあげる
Hey, shall I offer you a sweet trap? Look, I'll make you fall for it.

83
00:15:41,059 --> 00:15:49,059
そんな魔法かけるから ちょっとだけ待たせたげるわ
Since I'll cast that magic on you, I'll make you wait just a little bit.

84
00:16:12,059 --> 00:16:25,059
せっせっせのよいよいよい
Ses sese no yoi yoi yoi!

85
